    <briefdescription>
<para>Compact polynomial layout used inside the F4 GB engine. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput><ref refid="struct_g_b_f4_polynomial_ac67d4476404b77290ff7a27aa0ef8197_1ac67d4476404b77290ff7a27aa0ef8197" kindref="member">len</ref></computeroutput> is the number of terms, <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_g_b_f4_polynomial_aa62506d76c6ea762f99c6646508e3d74_1aa62506d76c6ea762f99c6646508e3d74" kindref="member">coeffs</ref></computeroutput> is the parallel <computeroutput><ref refid="class_element_array" kindref="compound">ElementArray</ref></computeroutput> of coefficients, and <computeroutput><ref refid="struct_g_b_f4_polynomial_a537e11618ac75bee33331c962074c2b0_1a537e11618ac75bee33331c962074c2b0" kindref="member">monoms</ref></computeroutput> is a flat buffer of <computeroutput><ref refid="moninfo_8hpp_afe2d8fe59c70630e71d82733c3f8ddcb_1afe2d8fe59c70630e71d82733c3f8ddcb" kindref="member">monomial_word</ref></computeroutput>s with every term&apos;s monomial laid out contiguously. Owned by an enclosing memory block; no destructor needed. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
